# Dependent-origination core spine v1.1

This aggregate extends the non-quantum contextual parent with explicit
refinement, overlap compatibility, state descent, and invariant semantic
descent.

```text
contextual state functor
  -> root-to-local refinement
  -> pairwise common refinements
  -> coherent root paths
  -> overlap-compatible local state families
  -> optional state-level descent
  -> optional local separation / unique state gluing
  -> invariant semantic readout
  -> unique semantic descent from compatibility alone.
```

The crucial distinction is retained:

```text
compatible local states
  != automatically one global state,

but

compatible local states + invariant readout
  => one unique global semantic value
```

for a nonempty chart family.

No groupoid, gauge, Choi matrix, completely-positive map, quantum comb,
Hamiltonian, spectral-gap theorem, or physical Yang--Mills authority is part of
this aggregate.
-/

